      "retrieved": "2026-10-12",
      "revision": 1354822366,
      "text": "Platonia insignis is a species of tree of the family Clusiaceae, and the sole species of genus Platonia. It is native the Amazon rainforest in tropical South America, ranging through northern and northeastern Brazil, southeastern Colombia, southern Venezuela, and the Guianas. Common names include bacuri, maniballi, naranjillo and bacurizeiro."
